n\nWhat You Will Experience:\n\nThe Hall of Leaders: Stand face-to-face with portraits of India's greatest visionaries, from the imperial might of Raja Raja Cholan to the leaders of the 21st century.\n\nScientific Breakthroughs: Discover the minds behind India's greatest contributions to science and astronomy.\n\nPivotal Wars & Victories: Learn about the battles that defended the land and the strategic brilliance of its commanders.\n\nCurated Exhibits: Each photo frame is paired with detailed historical context, allowing you to learn at your own pace.", "short_description": "Experience the Ages of India in VR. Walk through a curated gallery of heroes, wars, and discoveries, spanning from Raja Raja Cholan to today's visionaries."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.agesofindia.com/Privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CaveArt Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://caveartstudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1275861502279057"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1030979493097142"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1030979493097142"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1788193800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1030979493097142"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_sup